<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8">
        <title>Tommy Williams &mdash; VP of Design</title>
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <meta name="description" content="The portfolio of Tommy Williams, VP of Design, is being refined for a fresh launch. Available shortly &mdash; LinkedIn and direct contact remain open.">
        <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
        <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.webology.me/">
        <meta property="og:type" content="website">
        <meta property="og:site_name" content="Tommy Williams">
        <meta property="og:title" content="Tommy Williams &mdash; VP of Design">
        <meta property="og:description" content="The portfolio is being refined for a fresh launch. New case studies, sharper writing, and a clearer point of view on AI in design leadership &mdash; coming shortly.">
        <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.webology.me/">
        <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.webology.me/images/og-default.png">
        <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
        <meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
        <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
        <meta name="twitter:title" content="Tommy Williams &mdash; VP of Design">
        <meta name="twitter:description" content="The portfolio is being refined for a fresh launch. Available shortly.">
        <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.webology.me/images/og-default.png">
        <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="favicon.svg">
        <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="favicon-32x32.png">
        <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="favicon-16x16.png">
        <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="apple-touch-icon.png">
        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
        <style>
            *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
            html, body { height: 100%; overflow-x: hidden; }
            body {
                font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
                background: #1a1816;
                color: #f8f5f0;
                -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
                -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
                line-height: 1.5;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                min-height: 100vh;
                position: relative;
            }
            body::before {
                content: '';
                position: fixed;
                inset: 0;
                background:
                    radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 0%, rgba(184, 87, 24, 0.10) 0%, transparent 55%),
                    radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 100%, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.06) 0%, transparent 55%);
                pointer-events: none;
                z-index: 0;
            }
            .page { position: relative; z-index: 1; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

            .top-bar {
                padding: 36px 56px 0;
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-start;
                justify-content: space-between;
            }
            .wordmark {
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 500;
                letter-spacing: 0.24em;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.9);
                text-decoration: none;
                position: relative;
                padding-bottom: 12px;
            }
            .wordmark::after {
                content: '';
                position: absolute;
                left: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                width: 28px;
                height: 2px;
                background: #b85718;
            }
            .status-pill {
                font-size: 10px;
                font-weight: 500;
                letter-spacing: 0.2em;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: #fbbf24;
                padding: 7px 14px;
                border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.35);
                border-radius: 999px;
                background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.06);
                white-space: nowrap;
            }
            .status-pill .dot {
                display: inline-block;
                width: 6px;
                height: 6px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: #fbbf24;
                margin-right: 8px;
                vertical-align: middle;
                animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
            }
            @keyframes pulse {
                0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
                50% { opacity: 0.4; }
            }

            .main {
                flex: 1;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                padding: 32px 24px 80px;
            }
            .hero {
                max-width: 740px;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .eyebrow {
                font-size: 12px;
                font-weight: 500;
                letter-spacing: 0.24em;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: #fbbf24;
                margin-bottom: 32px;
            }
            h1 {
                font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
                font-size: clamp(40px, 6.5vw, 76px);
                font-weight: 400;
                letter-spacing: -0.02em;
                line-height: 1.05;
                color: #f8f5f0;
                margin-bottom: 28px;
            }
            h1 em {
                font-style: italic;
                color: #fbbf24;
                font-weight: 500;
            }
            .lede {
                font-size: 17px;
                line-height: 1.7;
                color: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.78);
                max-width: 580px;
                margin: 0 auto 40px;
            }
            .ctas {
                display: flex;
                gap: 12px;
                justify-content: center;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }
            .btn {
                display: inline-block;
                padding: 14px 28px;
                font-size: 12px;
                font-weight: 500;
                letter-spacing: 0.1em;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                text-decoration: none;
                border-radius: 2px;
                border: 1px solid;
                transition: all 0.2s ease;
                cursor: pointer;
            }
            .btn-primary {
                background: #b85718;
                color: #fff;
                border-color: #b85718;
            }
            .btn-primary:hover {
                background: #8f4413;
                border-color: #8f4413;
            }
            .btn-secondary {
                background: transparent;
                color: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.9);
                border-color: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.3);
            }
            .btn-secondary:hover {
                background: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.08);
                border-color: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.7);
                color: #fff;
            }
            .preview-link {
                margin-top: 56px;
                font-size: 12px;
                color: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.42);
                letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            }
            .preview-link a {
                color: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.82);
                text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.28);
                padding-bottom: 1px;
                transition: all 0.2s ease;
            }
            .preview-link a:hover {
                color: #fbbf24;
                border-bottom-color: #fbbf24;
            }

            .bottom-bar {
                padding: 28px 56px;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: center;
                font-size: 11px;
                color: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.4);
                letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            }
            .t-mark {
                width: 44px;
                height: 44px;
                border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4);
                border-radius: 6px;
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
                font-size: 24px;
                font-weight: 600;
                color: #fbbf24;
            }

            @media (max-width: 720px) {
                .top-bar { padding: 24px 24px 0; }
                .bottom-bar { padding: 20px 24px; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; }
                .ctas { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
                .btn { text-align: center; }
                .preview-link { margin-top: 44px; }
            }

            /* Consent banner (inlined; this page doesn't load style.css) */
            #consent-banner {
                position: fixed; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
                background: #1a1816; color: #f8f5f0; padding: 18px 28px;
                z-index: 9999; border-top: 1px solid #2a2522;
                font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
                box-shadow: 0 -4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
                animation: consent-rise 0.3s ease-out;
            }
            @keyframes consent-rise {
                from { transform: translateY(100%); opacity: 0; }
                to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
            }
            .consent-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
            .consent-text { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #d4d2cc; margin: 0; flex: 1 1 60%; min-width: 240px; }
            .consent-text a { color: #fbbf24; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4); }
            .consent-text a:hover { border-bottom-color: #fbbf24; }
            .consent-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-shrink: 0; }
            .consent-btn { font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 2px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: all 0.18s ease; white-space: nowrap; }
            .consent-btn-primary { background: #b85718; color: #fff; border-color: #b85718; }
            .consent-btn-primary:hover { background: #8f4413; border-color: #8f4413; }
            .consent-btn-text { background: transparent; color: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.75); border-color: rgba(248, 245, 240, 0.25); }
            .consent-btn-text:hover { color: #f8f5f0; border-color: #f8f5f0; }
            @media (max-width: 640px) {
                #consent-banner { padding: 16px 20px; }
                .consent-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
                .consent-actions { width: 100%; justify-content: flex-end; }
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="page">
            <header class="top-bar">
                <a href="/" class="wordmark">Tommy Williams</a>
                <span class="status-pill"><span class="dot"></span>In Progress</span>
            </header>

            <main class="main">
                <div class="hero">
                    <p class="eyebrow">VP of Design</p>
                    <h1>The portfolio is being <em>refined</em>.</h1>
                    <p class="lede">A new case study on Paciolan, a sharper point of view on AI in design leadership, and the work behind 15+ years of building product design organizations &mdash; coming together for a fresh launch shortly.</p>
                    <div class="ctas">
                        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/iamtommyw" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">Connect on LinkedIn</a>
                        <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-secondary">Get in Touch</a>
                    </div>
                    <p class="preview-link">For hiring managers and recruiters with this URL: <a href="home.html">view the work in progress &rarr;</a></p>
                </div>
            </main>

            <footer class="bottom-bar">
                <span>&copy; 2026 Tommy Williams</span>
                <span class="t-mark">T</span>
                <span>VP of Design &middot; Available for select conversations</span>
            </footer>
        </div>

        <script src="js/consent.js?v=1" defer></script>
    </body>
</html>
